<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>the blood &amp; the bliss</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Sick Joy</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">WE'RE ALL GONNA F***ING DIE.</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2VGKTsSQ2UD3UUyi73GJeQ</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">4 Contributors</p><p ttm:agent="v1">the blood &amp; the bliss Lyrics</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 1]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">All you needed was your set of sedatives</p><p ttm:agent="v1">To set aside, set aside your differences</p><p ttm:agent="v1">All you needed was your dark black lens</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And your solid gold, animal, kill it dead</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Pre-Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Drain me dry, I’m medicinal</p><p ttm:agent="v1">So deep down, I’m invincible now</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Because all you needed was your set of sedatives</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You’re the blood</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You are the bliss</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You got your shame</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Don’t let me down</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You got your shame</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Don’t let me down</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 2]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">All you needed was the death of everything</p><p ttm:agent="v1">For you to wreck and resurrect yourself again</p><p ttm:agent="v1">A high divе into a deep white den</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Grow your blue diamond bonеs and body of stone</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Starve your autocannibal</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Fuck me like an animal now[Pre-Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Because all you needed was your set of sedatives</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You’re the blood</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You are the bliss</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You got your shame</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Don’t let me down</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You got your shame</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Don’t let me down</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Bridge]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Duh duh duh-duh duh duh duh duh-duh down</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Duh duh duh-duh duh duh duh duh-duh down</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Instrumental]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You got your shame</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Don’t let me down</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You got your shame</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Don’t let me down</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You got your shame</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Don’t let me down</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You got your shame</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Don’t let me down</p></div></body></tt>